      "name": "BitMart",
      "ttsName": "Bit mart",
      "health": "degraded",
      "note": "Both symbols/details and quotation/v3/tickers return a truncated list to our probe (65 symbols, 24 ticker rows) rather than the full book. Prices that do come back parse correctly. Needs a check from a permitted region before promoting to ok.",
      "pairs": {
        "requests": [
          {
            "url": "https://api-cloud.bitmart.com/spot/v1/symbols/details"
